The Bomb went through some minor changes. Starting out with 0/5, it gained +1 HP in '''Beta 3.2''' and +1 ATK in '''Beta 4.2''', leaving it at 1/6.

During this time, Bomb's effect made it deal 3 damage to all enemies when your next turn starts, killing itself in the process. '''Beta 13.1''' buffed this by making it deal 1 extra damage to the enemy player, and '''Beta 18.1''' made it deal 1 extra damage to their monsters as well, making it deal 4 damage to all enemies. This, however, was completely reverted in '''Beta 22.0''', bringing it back to its Beta 4.2 version.

'''Beta 32.1''' brought its HP back to 5.

