** 3 DMG to all enemies. (Pre Beta 13.1)
** 3 DMG to all enemy monsters and 4 to the enemy. (Post Beta 13.1)
** 4 DMG to all enemies. (Post Beta 19.0)
** 3 DMG to all enemies. (Post Beta 22.0, Current)

Rarity: White (Common)
